    excerpt:
      "In the 1960s, Margaret Howe Lovatt lived alongside a dolphin named Peter in an extraordinary attempt to bridge the communication gap between humans and another species. What happened inside Dolphin House became one of the strangest and most controversial stories in animal research.",
    category: "Science",
