      "When that setup disappeared, the experiment effectively disappeared with it.",
      "## What Happened To Peter?",
      "Peter died only weeks after being transferred to Miami.",
      "Margaret later recalled receiving a call from Lilly in which he described Peter's death as suicide.",
      "There is a biological basis behind why people made that claim: dolphins are conscious breathers. They must actively surface to breathe rather than breathing automatically in the same way sleeping humans do.",
