      "A careful account can say Peter died soon after transfer and that Lilly described the death as suicide.",
      "It should not state as fact that Peter chose death from heartbreak.",
      "## Did The Experiment Fail?",
      "In one sense, yes.",
      "Peter never learned human language. Lilly's most ambitious goal was not achieved.",
      "The methodology would not meet many expectations of rigorous modern behavioral science: controlled conditions, reproducibility, independent measurement, stronger welfare protocols and clearer separation between observation and interpretation.",
      "In another sense, the episode exposed a serious question that science still cares about.",
      "How sophisticated is dolphin communication?",
      "Do dolphins use individual signals?",
      "How much do they learn socially?",
      "Can we understand animal communication without forcing it into a human-language frame?",
      "Dolphin House failed to teach a dolphin English.",
      "It did not end the study of dolphin intelligence.",
      "## What Science Knows About Dolphin Communication Today",
      "Modern dolphin research no longer depends on teaching dolphins to sound like humans.",
      "Scientists increasingly study dolphin communication on its own terms.",
      "Bottlenose dolphins use signature whistles: individually distinctive vocal signals often compared loosely to names. Research published in [Proceedings of the Royal Society B](https://royalsocietypublishing.org/doi/10.1098/rspb.2013.0053) showed that dolphins can respond to signature whistles copied from familiar individuals.",
      "Dolphins are sophisticated acoustic learners.",
      "They show complex social behavior, long-term social bonds and flexible vocal learning.",
      "They also use echolocation, producing clicks and interpreting returning echoes to build an acoustic picture of their environment.",
      "None of this means dolphins possess English-like language.",
      "It means dolphin communication is complex, meaningful in dolphin social life and worthy of study without turning dolphins into failed humans.",
      "That is a better question than the one Dolphin House tried to answer.",
      "## Could AI Finally Help Us Understand Dolphins?",
      "A modern PRESDA angle is unavoidable: AI may give animal communication research new tools.",
